{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/extras/25b1098c14e5590035e0d1cc5b8a21a3.poster.avif?t=1760035883\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/extras/25b1098c14e5590035e0d1cc5b8a21a3.webm?t=1760035883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/extras/25b1098c14e5590035e0d1cc5b8a21a3.mp4?t=1760035883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jump a rift, fight off monsters, and plunder their world</i>. Rift Riff is a tower defense game noteworthy in two ways: it's particularly strategic\u00a0and remarkably forgiving.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strategic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of the strategic layer of Rift Riff is a mix of choosing what towers you bring into each rift and being clever about the various monster behaviors. Monsters attack in waves, either going straight for your Extractor (your main tower) or attacking every tower in proximity. To defend yourself, you choose a handful of towers at the start of a scenario and build them on predetermined spots on the map. You obtain juice (your build resource) during monster waves and have the ability to build and upgrade towers before and during each wave. Surviving the onslaught of monsters gives you prisms, which in turn unlocks more rifts, towers, companions, and tower upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forgiving</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t have enough juice to build your tower? Schedule it. Built the wrong tower? Get a full refund. Lost a tower? It\u2019ll respawn for free after the wave. Lost your Extractor? Only redo the last wave. Having a hard time? Pick flowers for a bit of extra juice.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full game currently features \u00b1 15\u201320 hours of gameplay:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 worlds with 2 or more scenarios each.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >17 tower types with 7 overpowered upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 monster types with varying behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 companions who'll assist you and your towers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >45 challenges for die hards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the good Steam stuff: achievements, stats, controller support, cloud saves, etc.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have a suggestion or want to report a bug? Talk to the developers on the Steam Forums or on Discord.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Made by\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rift Riff is made by game designer Adriaan de Jongh (best known for the indie hit Hidden\u00a0Folks), graphic designer Sim Kaart, enemy wave designer Professional Panda, music composer and sound designer Matthijs Koster, and programmer Franz LaZerte. Rift Riff is made using the open source game engine Godot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/extras/ae793881989d844f0e84ea5b2eb1e32e.avif?t=1760035883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/extras_big/ae793881989d844f0e84ea5b2eb1e32e.avif?t=1760035883 width=800 height=100 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Knowledge, Gained","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/5cb572af6f1b31d258ec67d33f899b3d32ccfc0b.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Hunter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/9b6b510b4cdf7b76c9cb4ebfae40e1c07fdf3dba.jpg"},{"name":"Monster Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/7aab47ebfe45ca9135d4f9ef1fd3d0b7ef45fc0c.jpg"},{"name":"Rift Riffer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/a35e4d3aa78cb02430aabc6800c88b392df154b0.jpg"},{"name":"In the Dirt","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/df460f666341db5dfb0f5e8e3ff5e806a722362e.jpg"},{"name":"Spend It All","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/c93825726a1b52f7a9e6fc49a88b6a25c15e4586.jpg"},{"name":"Bigger Toolbox","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/27d3ef5734ccf05444285aa6258124a7a004ca4f.jpg"},{"name":"Was it Luck?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/e585d5c27b54d6adc2155dcb1d93fb587e993bc7.jpg"},{"name":"Now You Are Getting Good","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/aeb642aafea0f557e181736726b04a192e064e16.jpg"},{"name":"Keeper of the Dome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2800900/10e8522bfb991f31c7326520c86c25e4f3eb1882.jpg"}],"total":35},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2800900?t=1760035883","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/26f8f392f7b68f9602c8a65b36493a5e90644ec7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760035883","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/e0d345a394b7310ea3d8ac59fc6eba3b6a384be6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760035883","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2800900/e0d345a394b7310ea3d8ac59fc6eba3b6a384be6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760035883","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Com